Third-party software
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Python package of SentryTower uses the Python standard library only.
The container image (docker/Dockerfile) and the agent engine use the
following third-party software. It is installed from its official
distribution at build time; this repository does not copy its source,
except where noted.

Pi coding agent (@earendil-works/pi-coding-agent) 0.84.1
  License: MIT
  Source: https://www.npmjs.com/package/@earendil-works/pi-coding-agent
  The agent engine runs the Pi CLI. src/sentrytower/agent/numbered_read.ts
  is a SentryTower extension for Pi that uses its extension API.
  The image installs Pi and its 144 npm dependencies from
  docker/pi/package-lock.json (licenses of the dependencies: MIT 70,
  Apache-2.0 47, BSD-3-Clause 13, ISC 8, BlueOak-1.0.0 5, 0BSD 1). Each
  package keeps its license file in the image under /opt/pi-install.

